{"ref":"BDB, טָלָא","hw":"טָלָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">טָלָא</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. patch, spot (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, <em>patch</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">טָלוּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">33</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">טְלֻאִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:39\" href=\"/Genesis.30.39\">39</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טְלֻאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.16\">Ez 16:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">טְלֻאֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">Gn 30:35</a>; chiefly of <em>spotted, variegated</em> sheep and goats (Jacob & Laban); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָקֹד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֻדִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עקדים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">Gn 30:35</a>; ‖ both, v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:39\" href=\"/Genesis.30.39\">39</a> (all J); of high places, <em>variegated</em> (gaily-coloured shrines) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.16\">Ez 16:16</a>.<br><strong>Pu.</strong>  Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטֻלָּאוֹת</span> <em>patched</em>, of sandals <a data-ref=\"Joshua 9:5\" href=\"/Joshua.9.5\">Jos 9:5</a> (JE).","next":"BDB, טְלָאִים","prev":"BDB, טַל"}